To find the complex root z of the equation $z^6 + z^3 + 1 = 0$, we can rewrite the equation as
\begin{align*}
z^6 + z^3 + 1 &= 0, \\
z^3(z^3 + 1) &= -1, \\
z^3 \left(z^3 + \frac{1}{z^3} \right) &= -1 \left(\frac{1}{z^3} \right), \\
z^3 + \frac{1}{z^3} &= \pm i,
\end{align*}

